      <div type="clause" n="9">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And on Suðengla lage griðlagu þus stent: ðæt, gif hwa gefeohteð on cyrican oððon on cynges huse, þonne sy forworht eal þæt he age, and sy on cynges dome, hwæðer he lif age þe nage.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And according to southern English law, the law of sanctuary stands thus: if anyone fights in church or in the king’s house, then he is to forfeit all that he owns, and it is the king’s judgment whether he lives or dies.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 on Suðengla lage griðlagu þus stent, ðæt, gif hwa gefeohteð on cyrican oððon on cynges huse, þonne sy forworht eal þæt he age, 7 sy on cynges dome, hwæðer he lif age þe nage.</ab>
      </div>
